      en: "City of Children (Cidade da Criança) is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Brazil. The first theme park in Brazil, designed specifically for families and younger children. Opened in October 1968. Located in São Bernardo do Campo. Numerous classic carousels. This protected area is part of Brazil's rich wildlife and flora, from the Amazon rainforest to the Atlantic coastal forest (Mata Atlântica). Like many notable places in Brazil, it combines regional character with the wider significance of the world's fifth-largest country. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Brazil, where tropical nature, Portuguese heritage, samba, football, and Carnival come together.",
